  "instructions": [
    "Combine veal bones and tonkotsu broth powder in a large pot, then add enough water to cover.",
    "Bring to a boil over high heat, then reduce to low and simmer for 1 hour.",
    "Add sliced ginger and minced garlic to the pot, then continue to simmer for another 30 minutes.",
    "Strain the broth through a fine-mesh sieve into a clean pot, discarding solids.",
    "In a separate pan, heat sesame oil over medium heat, then add sliced green onions and sauté until softened.",
    "Add sliced veal meat to the pan, then cook until browned and cooked through.",
    "Add cooked veal meat and noodles to the pot with the tonkotsu broth, then stir to combine.",
    "Divide noodles and veal among bowls, then ladle hot broth over the top.",
    "Garnish with sliced pickled ginger and chopped green onions, if desired."
